    ]
  },
  "summary": {
    "en": [
      "Irene Morrow is married to Edward and has six children (Jeffrey, Patrick (deceased), Martin, Roberta, Lorraine and Christine) and six grandchildren (Matthew, Ryan, Nathan, Michaela, Aaron and Justin) Irene has an impressive resume of twenty-five years of public service. She served as Deputy Auditor in charge of Cuyahoga County payrolls for 8 years and was instrumental in computerizing the entire record keeping system. For seventeen years she served as the Personnel Administrator and Secretary of the Civil Service Commission for the City of Cleveland...."
    ]
